HIPMENT_NOT_FOUND)\n\n2. **ShipmentController.kt** — Added confirm() method with:\n   - `@PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")` mapping for the new endpoint\n   - Fetch shipment by ID with ResourceNotFoundException for not found (404)\n   - Check for CANCELLED status with ConflictException for conflict (409)\n   - Handle CREATED and CONFIRMED states by updating to CONFIRMED and returning 200 OK\n   - Uses repository.save() and entity.copy() to persist the state change\n   - Follows existing code style and error handling patterns\n   - Change was necessary to implement the feature\n\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Added 4 new test methods:\n   - \"`confirms a created shipment`\" — Verifies transition from CREATED to CONFIRMED with 200 OK\n   - \"`confirms an already confirmed shipment (idempotent)`\" — Verifies idempotency with 200 OK and no status change\n   - \"`rejects confirming a cancelled shipment`\" — Verifies 409 with SHIPMENT_CANNOT_BE_CONFIRMED\n   - \"`rejects confirming a non-existent shipment`\" — Verifies 404 with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\n   - Tests were necessary to satisfy acceptance criterion 5\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n\n```\nRequirement   Add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm to transition shipments from CREATED to CONFIRMED, handle retries idempotently, reject CANCELLED shipments with 409, and unknown IDs with 404.\nChanged       ApiError.kt: Added SHIPMENT_CANNOT_BE_CONFIRMED error code to distinguish confirming a CANCELLED shipment\n              ShipmentController.kt: Added confirm() endpoint method that transitions shipments to CONFIRMED, handles idempotency, and throws appropriate exceptions\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt: Added 4 test methods covering CREATED→CONFIRMED, idempotency, CANCELLED rejection, and not-found rejection\nVerification  ./mvnw test from sample-service/ returned BUILD SUCCESS with all 17 tests passing (9 shipment tests, 4 order tests, 3 customer tests, 1 application test)\nNot done      (nothing — all acceptance criteria met)\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3337,"cache_read_input_tokens":21191,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3337},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fcc51fee-1fa1-4850-9ecb-3ed723936982","uuid":"0962099b-50b8-4731-b74c-8cd2125824e6","timestamp":"2026-09-10T18:53:40.951Z","request_id":"req_011CevGKvj9fbz3KeWmJrYFz"}
